# Workflow lanes

## Fast Lane

Use only under experiments/ and notebooks/.

- Purpose: prototype and disposable research
- Allowed: quick scripts, notebooks, throwaway analysis
- Forbidden: modifying src/ production modules
- Forbidden: changing data contracts without a Control Lane Issue

## Control Lane

Use for formal code, documentation, and data contracts.

- Every task starts from a GitHub Issue
- Only modify files listed in Issue Allowed Files
- Do not touch Issue Forbidden Scope
- Run python -m pytest when Python code changes
- Open a PR with clear scope and test notes

## Agent discipline

- Read the full Issue before editing
- Do not expand scope beyond the Issue
- Do not continue closed or superseded PRs unless the Issue says so
